<section class="pixel-controls-section" aria-labelledby="pixel-companion-title" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div class="pixel-heading">
    <h2 id="pixel-companion-title">和小羽川一起</h2>
    <p id="pixel-status">她在屏幕里散步，拖一拖就能换个位置。</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pixel-controls" aria-label="选择小羽川的动作">
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="come">叫她过来</button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="walk" aria-pressed="true">自由散步</button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="read" aria-pressed="false"><span data-pixel-form-label="read">翻翻书</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="think" aria-pressed="false"><span data-pixel-form-label="think">推眼镜</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="stretch" aria-pressed="false">伸懒腰</button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="sleep" aria-pressed="false">打个盹</button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="wave" aria-pressed="false">挥挥手</button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" data-pixel-action="jump" aria-pressed="false">跳一下</button>
    <button type="button" class="cat-button pixel-action" id="pixel-pause" data-pixel-pause aria-pressed="false"><span data-pause-label>暂停</span></button>
    <button type="button" class="pixel-text-control" data-pixel-visibility>收起小羽川</button>
  </div>
  <p class="pixel-hint">她会自己走走停停。点击打招呼，拖动换位置；切换日夜，她也会变换形态。</p>
</section>
